    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us examine the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Шеф, я понял.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, I got it.' Fedya eagerly reports back, showing that he comprehended the previous instructions.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Вы добавили базилик, да?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You added basil, right?' The cook asks for confirmation about a recipe detail, completely ignoring the tension of the raid.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Чист.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Clear.' The officer gives a crisp, one-word confirmation that the inspection revealed no problems.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Проверили.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Checked.' Following up his previous statement, the official confirms that the examination is complete.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я так и знал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I knew it.' Barinov smugly asserts that he was right all along, projecting total confidence.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Виктор Петрович, ошибочка вышла.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Viktor Petrovich, a mistake happened.' The disappointed guest admits that their raid was based on incorrect information.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Мои люди проверили этого человека.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My people checked this person.' Explaining the process, the officer confirms that his team looked into the worker's background.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "inspector",
      "t": "Абсолютно чист.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Completely clean.' Reassuring the chef, the official declares the employee entirely free of any legal issues.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А я всегда знал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And I always knew.' The boss repeats his smug claim of prior knowledge, rubbing his victory in the officer's face.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Федя, ты как?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fedya, how are you?' Barinov checks in on his employee, asking about his well-being after the stressful event.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Нормально.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fine.' Fedya gives a short, casual response, brushing off the intensity of the situation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Ты как меня вытащил?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How did you get me out?' Puzzled by his sudden rescue, the cook asks his boss to explain the trick.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Ключи только у шефа были.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only the boss had keys.' The worker points out a logical flaw in the rescue, noting that access was restricted to one person.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Пусть он так думает.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
